<title>USA: MALEV ADDS JFK TO BUDAPEST/KIEV CARGO SVCE AUG 18.</title>
<headline>MALEV ADDS JFK TO BUDAPEST/KIEV CARGO SVCE AUG 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Malev airline will add a third weekly connecting cargo flight between Budapest and Kiev from August 18, Vincent Chabrol US cargo manger said.</p>
<p>The service, originating at New York's JFK on a Boeing 767-200, will connect in Budapest to the all cargo AN12, and continue to its Kiev destination. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
